or in official stores, where danger might also lurk around every corner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2946190/extras/3173a6bd0e4678f030369f3f981d6305.poster.avif?t=1737021912\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2946190/extras/3173a6bd0e4678f030369f3f981d6305.webm?t=1737021912\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2946190/extras/3173a6bd0e4678f030369f3f981d6305.mp4?t=1737021912\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2946190/extras/d12235b5d476012136aae07403ef4ace.avif?t=1737021912\" width=377 height=149 /></span>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shuttle Vulnerability</strong>: Your shuttle can be destroyed—make sure it doesn't happen!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3D Voice Chat and Sound</strong>: Experience immersive audio with 3D voice chat and environmental sounds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Procedurally Generated Maps</strong>: No two maps are alike, ensuring a unique experience every time!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Player Customization</strong>: Choose your body and accessories, then your corpse will not be confused with anyone!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Prepare the shuttle for flight, gather a team of brave astronauts and go on a thrilling journey through hostile space!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2946190/extras/1e97184b107cfe83c5489d74e94a6fba.poster.avif?t=1737021912\" width=600 height=338 ><sour